  "description": "Can you find love in a virtual world? Narae doesn’t really believe in love. BBQ restaurant owner by day and romance novelist by night, she’s too busy with work to pursue a relationship. When she gets a strange text that offers her the chance to find true love, she accepts it as a joke - until she actually ends up in a game. Will she be able to escape.. and find true love along the way?\n\n(Source: Manta)",
